WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.065
Do you have brothers or sisters?

00:00:02.315 --> 00:00:05.499
Yes, I have a sister. Her name is Emma.

00:00:05.749 --> 00:00:07.378
What does she like doing?

00:00:07.628 --> 00:00:09.879
She likes reading and playing football.

00:00:10.129 --> 00:00:12.287
We play together on Sundays.
